@startuml
' High-level Resume-Analyzer — vertical layout

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 60
top to bottom direction

actor "End User" as User

rectangle "Client / Browser" as Browser {
  component "Frontend (React + Vite)" as Frontend
  component "Puter.js (in-browser AI)" as Puter
}

node "Deployment / Edge" as Edge {
  [Nginx Reverse Proxy] as Nginx
  [Static Host (CDN)] as StaticHost
}

rectangle "Backend Service (FastAPI)" as Backend {
  component "Uvicorn / FastAPI\nmain:app" as FastAPI
  component "Resume Parser\n(PyPDF2, python-docx)" as Parser
  component "Job Recommender\n(nlp_utils, job_recommender.py)" as Recommender
  component "API Endpoints\nPOST /parse_resume\nPOST /save_resume_data" as API
}

database "MySQL (persistent storage)" as MySQL
folder "Local File Storage / S3 (optional)" as Storage
file "jobs_mock.json (sample jobs)" as JobsMock

' Vertical flow (top -> bottom)
User --> Frontend : open app / upload resume / paste JD
Frontend --> StaticHost : fetch static assets
StaticHost --> Frontend : serve bundle
Frontend --> Nginx : POST /parse_resume (file)
Nginx --> FastAPI : forward request
FastAPI --> Parser : extract text (PDF/DOCX)
Parser --> FastAPI : parsed plain text
FastAPI --> Frontend : return parsed text (JSON)
Frontend --> Puter : analyze parsed text + JD locally
Frontend --> Nginx : POST /save_resume_data (structured result)
Nginx --> FastAPI : forward save request
FastAPI --> MySQL : persist structured resume
FastAPI --> Storage : (optional) store file/artifacts
FastAPI --> Recommender : compute job matches
Recommender --> FastAPI : recommendations
FastAPI --> Frontend : saved id / recommendations

' Internal / optional flows
FastAPI --> JobsMock : read sample jobs (fallback)
FastAPI --> Storage : offload large files to S3 (optional)

' Deployment hints
Nginx --> Edge : deployed at edge (reverse proxy / static host)
FastAPI --> Edge : backend runs behind proxy (container or host)
MySQL --> Edge : managed DB or container

note top of Frontend
  In-browser AI (Puter.js)
  — privacy-first: analysis runs locally
end note

note bottom of FastAPI
  Backend responsibilities:
  - Receive files and extract text
  - Persist structured data
  - Provide simple job recommendations
  (No external AI calls from backend)
end note

@enduml